{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>לכל עמי</b> — until my people made sport of me. Or: all the people that was under my hand, like <i>et Amalek ve-et amo</i> (Exodus 17:13). Or the yod is added. And <i>vatifalteni merivei ammi</i> (II Samuel 22:44) is not like <i>amim</i>, for Saul is alluded to, and likewise he said at the beginning of the song, <i>umikkaf Sha'ul</i>."], :book :lamentations, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Lamentations -- Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%9E%D7%92%D7%99%D7%9C%D7%AA_%D7%90%D7%99%D7%9B%D7%94"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:41.362701060Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}